  "description": "UMUFIU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C89 H96 La4 N16 O27 2+,C3 H7 N1 O1,2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.882-5.542 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.08-167.66°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La4L4(CO3)]Cl2·DMF (C89H96La4N16O27 2+, C3H7NO, 2 Cl−).",
